          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "NTSB Probable Cause",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              522.9043579101562,
              170.1379852294922,
              533.9043579101562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12493",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              535.0269775390625,
              79.0199966430664,
              544.0269775390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The airplane’s encounter with severe icing conditions that were characterized by high ice accretion rates and the pilot’s failure ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              545.0950927734375,
              560.526123046875,
              555.0950927734375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to use command authority to depart the icing conditions in an expeditious manner, which resulted in a loss of airplane control.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              556.0950927734375,
              557.9411010742188,
              566.0950927734375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "NTSB Factual Summary Excerpts (edited)",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              580.2042236328125,
              270.9969787597656,
              591.2042236328125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12494",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              592.3269653320312,
              79.0199966430664,
              601.3269653320312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot departed Teterboro, NJ (TEB) on an IFR flight plan to Atlanta, GA (PDK). No evidence of a weather briefing was ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              602.3952026367188,
              560.4976806640625,
              612.3952026367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "found, although the pilot may have obtained weather information from non-government sources. There was an AIRMET for ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              613.3952026367188,
              560.5159301757812,
              623.3952026367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "moderate icing in northern New Jersey and westward from the freezing level (2,000 to 8,000 feet) to 20,000 feet. There were ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              624.3952026367188,
              560.5228271484375,
              634.3952026367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "numerous pilot reports of moderate to severe icing and a Center Weather Advisory (CWA) issued, as depicted in ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              635.3952026367188,
              504.83807373046875,
              645.3952026367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ".",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              549.17578125,
              635.3952026367188,
              551.67578125,
              645.3952026367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Figure C-2",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              504.8301086425781,
              635.4243774414062,
              549.1771240234375,
              645.4243774414062
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
