      },
      {
        "page_number": 67,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "After dinner, they returned to the helicopter for the return flight. The Wakulla airport and the area around it were poorly lit, and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              45.831321716308594,
              560.5068969726562,
              55.83132553100586
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "after liftoff, the helicopter impacted 50-foot trees about 350 feet from the liftoff point. The pilot and one passenger suffered fatal ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              56.831321716308594,
              560.4860229492188,
              66.8313217163086
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "injuries and the other passenger was severely injured.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              67.8313217163086,
              267.84002685546875,
              77.8313217163086
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12509",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              79.56305694580078,
              79.0199966430664,
              88.56305694580078
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot had only one hour of night flight experience in the previous 11 months and did not possess an instrument rating. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              89.63130950927734,
              560.5263671875,
              99.63130950927734
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Witnesses to the accident stated the area around the airport was dark or “very dark.” The pilot was taking a disqualifying drug ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              100.63130950927734,
              560.5211791992188,
              110.63130950927734
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "that can cause drowsiness, although the NTSB did not assert this as a factor in the accident.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              111.63130950927734,
              419.50006103515625,
              121.63130950927734
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12510",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              123.36310577392578,
              79.0199966430664,
              132.3631134033203
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The surviving passenger stated that the pilot was in a hurry to return home and spend time with his daughter.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              133.43136596679688,
              488.3509826660156,
              143.43136596679688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Risk Identification, Assessment, and Mitigation",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              157.54049682617188,
              299.9191589355469,
              168.54049682617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12511",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              169.6631622314453,
              78.35759735107422,
              178.6631622314453
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At least three of the four risk categories in the PAVE checklist may relate to this accident. The pilot had minimal night currency ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              179.73141479492188,
              560.521728515625,
              189.73141479492188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "for this flight. In addition, aeromedical factors may have affected the pilot’s perception of the environment.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              190.73141479492188,
              482.5769348144531,
              200.73141479492188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12513",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              202.4632110595703,
              79.0199966430664,
              211.4632110595703
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The airport environment hazard contributed to the risk present at takeoff. The 50-foot trees near the takeoff zone resulted in a ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              212.53146362304688,
              560.5241088867188,
              222.53146362304688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "normal takeoff and climb that did not provide safe clearance during climb out. A hovering takeoff and climb also might have ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              223.53146362304688,
              560.5068969726562,
              233.53146362304688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "been hazardous at night in a dark environment.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              234.53146362304688,
              241.74002075195312,
              244.53146362304688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12512",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              246.26307678222656,
              79.0199966430664,
              255.26307678222656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "External pressures relate to the pilot’s desire to return as soon as possible. Perhaps this caused him to rush through the start-up ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
