              428.0630798339844,
              79.0199966430664,
              437.0630798339844
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•\t NTSB Case File Number: CEN17FA072",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              76.5,
              438.13134765625,
              248.64300537109375,
              448.13134765625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "NTSB Probable Cause",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              462.240478515625,
              170.1379852294922,
              473.240478515625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12520",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              474.3631896972656,
              79.0199966430664,
              483.3631896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Controlled flight into terrain due to pilot spatial disorientation. Contributing to the accident was pilot fatigue, mode confusion ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              484.43145751953125,
              560.5158081054688,
              494.43145751953125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "related to the status of the autopilot, and negative learning transfer due to flight guidance panel and attitude indicator differences ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              495.43145751953125,
              560.5220947265625,
              505.43145751953125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "from the pilot’s previous experience.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              506.4314880371094,
              200.9090118408203,
              516.4314575195312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "NTSB Factual Summary Excerpts (edited)",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              530.54052734375,
              270.9969787597656,
              541.54052734375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12521",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              542.6631469726562,
              79.0199966430664,
              551.6631469726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot and five passengers flew to the Burke Lakefront Airport (BKL) earlier to attend a sporting event. They arrived back at ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              552.7313842773438,
              560.538818359375,
              562.7313842773438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "BKL around 2230 for the return flight to Columbus, Ohio. Although BKL was VFR, the ceiling was 2300 feet and the departure ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              563.7313842773438,
              560.51318359375,
              573.7313842773438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "took place in full darkness. Within two minutes after takeoff, the single pilot lost control of the aircraft. The radar track showed ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              574.7313842773438,
              560.5087280273438,
              584.7313842773438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the aircraft climbing through its assigned altitude and then flying erratically before plunging into Lake Erie with a descent rate ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              585.7313842773438,
              560.5150756835938,
              595.7313842773438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of about 6,000 feet per minute.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              596.7313842773438,
              177.5900115966797,
              606.7313842773438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12522",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              608.4631958007812,
              79.0199966430664,
              617.4631958007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot had been awake for 17 hours at takeoff. He had recently transitioned from another small jet and completed aircraft ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              618.5314331054688,
              560.5340576171875,
              628.5314331054688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and simulator training, resulting in a single-pilot type rating only three weeks before the accident. According to his instructors, ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              629.5314331054688,
              560.502197265625,
              639.5314331054688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "he had been taught to operate using the autopilot most of the time. He may have suffered from mode confusion regarding the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              640.5314331054688,
              560.505126953125,
              650.5314331054688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "configuration and status of the autopilot in the new aircraft, and may not have verified autopilot engagement. He may also have ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              651.5314331054688,
              560.5079345703125,
              661.5314331054688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "experienced external pressure to return to Columbus that evening.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              662.5314331054688,
              317.5600280761719,
              672.5314331054688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Risk Identification, Assessment, and Mitigation",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              686.6405639648438,
              299.9191589355469,
              697.6405639648438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12523",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              698.7630615234375,
              79.0199966430664,
              707.7630615234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Several categories on the PAVE checklist may apply to this accident. The pilot may have been fatigued. It is likely that his ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              708.831298828125,
              560.5155029296875,
              718.831298828125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "expectation and that of the passengers was to return to Columbus immediately after the event. After departure, he may have ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              719.831298828125,
              560.5130004882812,
              729.831298828125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "unconsciously applied procedures appropriate to his previous experience. The nighttime environment and departure over the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              730.831298828125,
              560.5079345703125,
              740.831298828125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "lake required the pilot to both monitor the flight instruments and deal with the automation.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              741.831298828125,
              415.8799133300781,
              751.831298828125
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "page_number": 68,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The catastrophic consequences associated with this accident, when combined with at least occasional likelihood, created a highrisk level for loss of control. In hindsight, having a second pilot or “mentor pilot” for this flight may have reduced the likelihood ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              45.831321716308594,
              558.0161743164062,
              55.83132553100586
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of loss of control. In addition, remaining overnight in Cleveland would have provided needed rest for the pilot and allowed for ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              67.8313217163086,
              560.52001953125,
              77.8313217163086
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "a departure during daylight, which also could have reduced the likelihood of loss of control.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              78.8313217163086,
              421.7200012207031,
              88.8313217163086
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
